/E (The Arab League serves as a vital platform for cooperation among Arab states, enabling dialogue and collective action on political, economic, and security challenges facing the region. In addressing the crisis in Sudan, the Arab League has a crucial role in coordinating humanitarian assistance, supporting diplomatic mediation, and promoting stability that safeguards both the Sudanese people and the wider region. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
